  "ACCESSORIES ARE SYMBOLS ON A JOINT: a hat, cap or helmet a figure wears (character `wears: [\"militaryCap\"]`) is a still thing — one Library symbol placed every picture on the head, sized and placed from the head radius, following the head's place and tilt, its peak the way the figure faces, drawn over the head.",
